 "description": "Upper machine: the portal shows Received until the handoff is confirmed; the CRM then owns the case, which moves from under review to approved and resolved, or to rejected. Lower machine: the handoff moves from pending to in_flight when a worker claims it, then to confirmed, to retry_due after an uncertain or temporary failure, or to manual_review after a rejection or six hours of retries. An operator can return a manual_review handoff to retry_due.",
